{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/extras/b6841371a859cb6d0c0388bd2526fb3f.webp?t=1759219777\" width=123 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure,\u00a0Your siblings are being controlled and calling themselves &quot;The revengers of Millonaire Bunny&quot;\u00a0approaching with the mission of steal the Blaster Power\u00a0from Gunner Bunny and the new protagonist Imitator Bunny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is defeat them, through a haunted castle with falling walls, a gigant space ship with star skulls, a abandoned construction in a snowy mountain, a sewers full of strange viruses,\u00a0<strong>and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is controlling them? Why?\u00a0How will they &quot;Steal&quot; the Blaster Power? There will be some epic plot-twist? Why the carrot continue been so delicious?\u00a0<strong>Answer those questions in Blaster Bunny Chronicles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/extras/b3659dc92473df3e5edfbdcbfb8876c2.webp?t=1759219777\" width=177 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/extras/fdb5a02d68f181e646634e1029239abc.webp?t=1759219777\" width=123 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaster Bunny Chronicles is the second game of &quot;The Princess Trilogy&quot;, a classic action platform game, choose a bunny, go through they stage with different gimmicks and face they in a battle to get their ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/extras/c97ea6a683209f44023bbb5b890a63bf.webp?t=1759219777\" width=380 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/extras/ea948bd3d008d0494e542244cadc4526.webp?t=1759219777\" width=195 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u00a0Difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Languages (English and Spanish)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And more secrets!!!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/extras/94387309819c0ff417a1f269ba49cf00.webp?t=1759219777\" width=222 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack was created by\u00a0<strong>Sweep Blast Studios</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834730?t=1759219777","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/b2cf130a5fc5a78b2c428224fe5e0623b02c1716/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759219777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/52a45baef260d91f9087f3ef6ad316ffb4ff6302/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759219777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834730/52a45baef260d91f9087f3ef6ad316ffb4ff6302/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759219777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_